{"id":"n776b4d8b2a","headline":"Indian Oil Forecasts Country's Gasoline Demand Will Peak by 2035","summary":"Indian Oil Corporation Chairman A S Sahney projected that India's gasoline demand will reach its peak by 2035. The transition is driven by expanding electric vehicle adoption, higher ethanol blending ratios, and natural gas usage.","why":"India is one of the world's fastest-growing oil consumers; long-term shifts in its motor fuel demand impact global refining and crude oil markets.","category":"commodities","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.614,"lon":77.209,"region":"asia"},"entities":[{"name":"Indian Oil Corporation","ticker":"IOC.NS"}],"links":[],"source":{"name":"OilPrice.com","url":"https://oilprice.com/Latest-Energy-News/World-News/Indias-Gasoline-Demand-Could-Peak-by-2035-as-EVs-Gain-Ground.html"},"sources":[{"name":"OilPrice.com","url":"https://oilprice.com/Latest-Energy-News/World-News/Indias-Gasoline-Demand-Could-Peak-by-2035-as-EVs-Gain-Ground.html"}],"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:30:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-10-28T18:45:13Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"score":44.8,"content_hash":"62bcce7b86315c2c","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/electric-car-charging-2783573.jpg","alt":"electric car charging (illustration)","credit":"Joenomias","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/electric-car-hybrid-car-load-2783573/"}}